 "section_summary": "This section comprises the final portion of the GHQ SCAP Civil Information and Education Section's educational roster for Aichi Prefecture (pages 481-543) and the opening cover and contents pages of the report for Tokushima Prefecture (pages 544-545). The Aichi pages detail public and private schools, colleges, middle and girls' high schools, youth schools, specialized vocational facilities, and schools administered by non-education ministries, complete with 1946 enrollment and faculty statistics and a concluding map of Central Honshu. Pages 544-545 introduce SCAP Special Report AR-302-E-A-26-39 for Tokushima Prefecture, dated 15 May 1948.",
