   "summary": "This concluding portion of the Aichi Prefecture educational roster lists town and village elementary schools, municipal kindergartens, private colleges, commercial and industrial schools, middle schools, girls' high schools, youth schools, and institutions operated under other government ministries. For each institution, it records foundation dates, gender-segregated and total enrollments, and teacher counts as of 30 April and 30 November 1946, concluding with a reference map of Central Honshu.",
